      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Ti-rich grain-boundary precipitates will improve grain-boundary cohesion in the target alloy.",
